WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.520
- This is really a risky thing

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.096
I've wanted to do all my
life and I finally did it.

00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:04.929
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:06.530
- So, as you mentioned, I
just released my 65th album.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:07.710
- Yeah that's, congratulations!

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.431
That's so cool!
- Thank you, it's so, I mean

00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:11.571
(applause)

00:00:11.571 --> 00:00:16.350
so it's about a fifteen
minute improv section

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.970
where I put all 65 albums on
the huge screens behind me,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.480
and I turn to the audience and say,

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.030
'Okay, the show is yours.'

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:25.120
I have no idea what's going to happen,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.440
it's all improv, you can pick any song

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.090
from any album that I've ever done

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.410
in my entire life, and
we're gonna do it for you.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.243
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:32.243 --> 00:00:33.670
- [Donny] It is, it's my
favorite part of the show.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.590
- Wait, I'm stressed thinking about it.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:36.830
- [Donny] Oh it's so fun!

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:37.663
- That's cool though that it's improv

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:38.815
and they get, because most shows

00:00:38.815 --> 00:00:40.930
you know, you go see a show, like a tour

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:41.899
that's the same show every night

00:00:41.899 --> 00:00:42.732
- [Donny] Yeah.

00:00:42.732 --> 00:00:43.565
- So that's cool, it's different.

00:00:43.565 --> 00:00:44.398
- [Donny] My show is
different every night.

00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:45.231
- Oh that's so cool!

00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:46.064
- [Woman Guest] Fun!

00:00:46.064 --> 00:00:46.897
- I love that!

00:00:46.897 --> 00:00:47.778
- Do they ever ask for One Bad Apple?

00:00:47.778 --> 00:00:49.342
- [Donny] We do One Bad Apple.

00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:50.175
- Oh good!

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.008
I love that song!

00:00:51.008 --> 00:00:52.674
(Kelly laughing)
- Except we, what we do is we,

00:00:52.674 --> 00:00:53.960
- That's with all the brothers.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.500
- Oh, that was some of
our first number one,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.333
- I know.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.140
- In fact, Michael told
me that, allegedly,

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.890
it was written for the J Five, and I said,

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.060
'well I got one on you Mike,'

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.455
Ben, his number one solo Ben,

00:01:05.455 --> 00:01:06.288
- [Woman Guest] Yeah?

00:01:06.288 --> 00:01:07.121
- Was written for me.

00:01:07.121 --> 00:01:07.954
- [Woman Guest] Whoa!

00:01:07.954 --> 00:01:09.710
- Oh my god, really?
- [Donny] That was my song.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:10.543
- [Woman Guest] What happened?

00:01:10.543 --> 00:01:11.376
- Well I was on,

00:01:11.376 --> 00:01:12.209
- That was on that creepy movie.

00:01:12.209 --> 00:01:13.180
- It was about a rat or some Willard?

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:14.013
- Yes, about rats.

00:01:14.013 --> 00:01:15.369
Willard, Willard!

00:01:15.369 --> 00:01:17.450
- Which I always though was interesting,

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.412
Michael sang about a rat,
I sang about a puppy.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:22.466
(guest and Kelly laughing)

00:01:22.466 --> 00:01:23.672
- Fascination with animals.

00:01:23.672 --> 00:01:24.505
(Donny laughing)

00:01:24.505 --> 00:01:25.338
- [Donny] Exactly!

00:01:25.338 --> 00:01:26.171
- It's fine.

00:01:26.171 --> 00:01:27.004
- But I said, 'yeah Ben
was written for me.'

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:27.837
The reason I didn't record Ben was

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:30.880
I was on the road,
touring with my brothers,

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.150
and they had to finish the movie,

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.790
and the producer said, 'well,
there is this little kid

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.570
named Michael Jackson,
let's get him to sing.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:36.950
He's got a high voice.'

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.793
And it became his song.

00:01:38.793 --> 00:01:39.980
It's so funny,

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:42.510
- [Kelly] That's so funny
how songs find their homes.

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:43.700
- Yeah, they find their homes,

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.210
and Mike and I would laugh
about it all the time.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:47.043
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:47.043 --> 00:01:49.080
That's so, your life was so crazy cool!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.413
- [Donny] It was crazy.

